r_year": null, "description": "NEWSchool (Integrierte Sekundarschule) (KEIN Schulbetrieb) is a private school located in Berlin, Germany. Founded in 2015 by individuals associated with the start-up network Factory Berlin, the school is situated on Lohmühlenstraße in the Alt-Treptow neighborhood of the Treptow-Köpenick district. Operating as an Integrierte Sekundarschule, the institution is officially classified as a state-recognized substitute school. According to the Berlin Senate Department for Education, school operations are currently suspended, with official records noting that the school will remain dormant until July 31, 2026.\n\nCurriculum and Academic Program\n\nThe official academic framework of the school includes a primary school section and an upper secondary level. The institution also holds provisions for second-chance education. Upon its initial foundation, the institution was structured as an all-day school.\n\nLanguage and International Orientation\n\nThe school provides English as part of its language offerings.\n\nTeaching Staff and Learning Environment\n\nAccording to official directories, the school is registered under the leadership of Kirsten Henschke.", "geo_country": "DE", "school_type": "ISS", "schulnummer": "09P21", "crime_source": "Kriminalitätsatlas Berlin per Bezirk", "open_days_en": [], "tuition_tier": "high", "traegerschaft": "Privat", "tuition_notes": "No fee information available; website is for sale and contains no school details. No PDFs found.", "besonderheiten": null, "description_de": "Die NEWSchool ist eine private, staatlich anerkannte Ersatzschule im Berliner Bezirk Treptow-Köpenick. Gegründet wurde die Einrichtung im Jahr 2015 durch Akteure aus dem Umfeld des Start-up-Netzwerks Factory Berlin, was ihr eine innovative und zukunftsorientierte Prägung verleiht. Die Schule befindet sich in der Lohmühlenstraße im Ortsteil Alt-Treptow und ist als Integrierte Sekundarschule konzipiert. Aktuell ist der Schulbetrieb jedoch offiziell ruhend gestellt; laut der Berliner Senatsverwaltung für Bildung bleibt die Schule voraussichtlich bis zum 31. Juli 2026 pausiert. Das pädagogische Rahmenkonzept umfasst sowohl eine Grundschulabteilung als auch eine gymnasiale Oberstufe sowie Angebote für den zweiten Bildungsweg. Sie bietet ein umfassendes Lernumfeld, in dem Englisch eine zentrale Rolle im Sprachangebot spielt. Unter der Leitung von Kirsten Henschke verfolgt die Schule das Ziel, Bildung in einem dynamischen, modernen Umfeld neu zu gestalten.", "description_en": "NEWSchool is a private, state-recognized substitute school located in the Alt-Treptow neighborhood of Berlin's Treptow-Köpenick district. Founded in 2015 by members of the Factory Berlin startup network, the institution brings an innovative spirit to the local educational landscape. Situated on Lohmühlenstraße, the school is structured as an integrated secondary school designed to offer a modern learning experience. It is important for families to note that official school operations are currently suspended, with records indicating that the school will remain dormant until July 31, 2026. The academic framework is comprehensive, encompassing a primary school section, an upper secondary level, and provisions for second-chance education. It emphasizes a holistic educational environment where English is featured as a key component of the language curriculum. Led by Kirsten Henschke, the school represents a unique intersection between Berlin's dynamic startup culture and formal secondary education.", "gruendungsjahr": null, "lehrer_2022_23": null, "lehrer_2023_24": null, "lehrer_2024_25": null, "lehrer_current": null, "belastungsstufe": null, "crime_data_year": "2025", "crime_rate_year": 2025, "metadata_source": null, "tuition_display": "Contact school", "crime_area_level": "district", "crime_change_pct": -6.2, "data_school_year": "2024_25", "env_aqi_category": null, "geo_municipality": "Berlin", "lehrer_data_year": null, "plz_interpolated": fal