: [0], "confidence": []}, {"end": 139, "text": "Founded in 2020", "start": 124, "sources": [1], "confidence": []}, {"end": 245, "text": "Founded in 2020, the school is situated in the Charlottenburg neighborhood within the Charlottenburg-Wilmersdorf district", "start": 124, "sources": [2, 0], "confidence": []}, {"end": 469, "text": "While it was established to offer a comprehensive secondary education, official registries from the Berlin Senate Department for Education currently list the school as having no active school operations (KEIN Schulbetrieb)", "start": 247, "sources": [2], "confidence": []}, {"end": 712, "text": "At the heart of Mentora Gymnasium is a commitment to holistic development and academic rigor, aiming to prepare young people for the challenges of an increasingly complex, globalized, and digitized society", "start": 507, "sources": [3], "confidence": []}, {"end": 922, "text": "The school's educational approach places a strong focus on the intersection of STEM (mathematics, information technology, natural sciences, and technology) and the visual arts, a concept it refers to as MINKT", "start": 714, "sources": [3], "confidence": []}, {"end": 1051, "text": "The school believes that integrating the arts into STEM fields motivates students to engage deeply with scientific activities", "start": 926, "sources": [4], "confidence": []}, {"end": 1242, "text": "This interdisciplinary approach allows STEM concepts to be presented in innovative, visual ways, helping students express their ideas through models, graphics, and descriptive communication", "start": 1053, "sources": [4], "confidence": []}, {"end": 1392, "text": "Mentora Gymnasium offers a national curriculum aligned with the requirements for the Abitur and the Mittlere Reife", "start": 1278, "sources": [4], "confidence": []}, {"end": 1500, "text": "Students follow a structured academic program with a distinct mathematical and natural science orientation", "start": 1394, "sources": [4], "confidence": []}, {"end": 1607, "text": "The institution is classified as a state-recognized substitute school (staatlich anerkannte Ersatzschule)", "start": 1502, "sources": [2], "confidence": []}, {"end": 1681, "text": "The institution is classified as a state-recognized substitute school (staatlich anerkannte Ersatzschule) and includes provisions for second-chance education (Zweiter Bildungsweg)", "start": 1502, "sources": [2], "confidence": []}, {"end": 1875, "text": "Project-based learning, where individually determined focus areas are integrated into compulsory elective subjects and conducted during weekly project days", "start": 1720, "sources": [3], "confidence": []}, {"end": 2011, "text": "The school places particular importance on an international orientation and language learning", "start": 1918, "sources": [3], "confidence": []}, {"end": 2199, "text": "The foreign language curriculum is structured to support this global perspective, with English offered as the first foreign language and Spanish introduced as the second foreign language", "start": 2013, "sources": [2], "confidence": []}, {"end": 2250, "text": "Located at Salzufer 6", "start": 2229, "sources": [2], "confidence": []}, {"end": 2412, "text": "These include a cafeteria and a kiosk for student meals and refreshments", "start": 2340, "sources": [4], "confidence": []}, {"end": 2488, "text": "The building is accessible, featuring barrier-free toilets and ramp access", "start": 2414, "sources": [2], "confidence": []}, {"end": 2579, "text": "To further support families, the school offers full-day care (Ganztagsbetreuung) services", "start": 2490, "sources": [4], "confidence": []}], "generated_at": "2026-10-03T14:16:23Z"}, "env_pollen_fetched_at": null, "meal_plan_monthly_eur": null, "plz_avg_cars_per_hour": 42.4, "plz_bike_friendliness": 0.415, "plz_observation_count": null, "plz_std_cars_per_hour": null, "plz_traffic_intensity": "low", "poi_kita_01_longitude": 13.325182, "poi_kita_02_longitude": 13.3352826, "